 ={u}^{′}{e}^{3t}+3u{e}^{3t} \\\\ {y}_{2}^{″} & ={u}^{″}{e}^{3t}+6{u}^{′}{e}^{3t}+9u{e}^{3t}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into the differential equation gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}({u}^{″}{e}^{3t}+6{u}^{′}{e}^{3t}+9u{e}^{3t})-6({u}^{′}{e}^{3t}+3u{e}^{3t})+9(u{e}^{3t}) & =0 \\\\ {u}^{″}{e}^{3t}+6{u}^{′}{e}^{3t}+9u{e}^{3t}-6{u}^{′}{e}^{3t}-18u{e}^{3t}+9u{e}^{3t} & =0 \\\\ {u}^{″}{e}^{3t} & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince ${e}^{3t}\\ne 0$ we must have\n\n$$\n{u}^{″}=0.\n$$\n\nLet $w={u}^{′}.$ Then our equation becomes\n\n$$\n{w}^{′}=0.\n$$\n\nHence, the solution is\n\n$$\nw={c}_{1}.\n$$\n\nBut since $w={u}^{′},$ we have:\n\n$$\n{u}^{′}={c}_{1}\\,⟹\\,u={c}_{1}t+{c}_{2}\n$$\n\nThus, our expression for ${y}_{2}(t)=u{e}^{3t}$ becomes\n\n$$\n{y}_{2}(t)={e}^{3t}({c}_{1}t+{c}_{2}).\n$$\n\nSetting ${c}_{1}=1$ and ${c}_{2}=0,$ we get\n\n$$\n{y}_{2}(t)={e}^{3t}\\cdot t=t{e}^{3t}.\n$$\n\nFinally, because $W({y}_{1},{y}_{2})={e}^{6t}\\ne 0,$ we know that ${y}_{1}$ and ${y}_{2}$ are independent (you should verify this calculation yourself).\n\nTherefore, the general solution is\n\n$$\ny=A{e}^{3t}+Bt{e}^{3t}.\n$$" 13194139535356 true] [17592186345555 1000 #edb/ref 17592186345556 13194139535356 true] [17592186345555 1000 #edb/ref 17592186345557 13194139535356 true] [17592186345555 1000 #edb/ref 17592186345558 13194139535356 true] [17592186345555 1000 #edb/ref 17592186345559 13194139535356 true] [17592186345555 1000 #edb/ref 17592186345560 13194139535356 true] [17592186345555 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535356 true] [17592186345555 1041 "selection" 13194139535356 true] [17592186345555 1104 #edb/ref 17592186345556 13194139535356 true] [17592186345555 1110 #uuid "7917a17f-497a-5000-a3d2-9b83597ec9ef" 13194139535356 true] [17592186345556 1034 "y=A{e}^{3t}+Bt{e}^{3t}" 13194139535356 true] [17592186345556 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535356 true] [17592186345556 1111 #uuid "8fd2d81f-6363-5eb0-a4ad-867b31c6cea6" 13194139535356 true] [17592186345557 1034 "y=